---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Hanfu Dress Guide privacy policy: how we collect, use, and protect your data. We do not require accounts or use tracking cookies for advertising."
  canonicalUrl="https://dresses-hanfu.com/legal/privacy"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Privacy Policy", url: "/legal/privacy" }]}
  articleSchema={{
    datePublished: "2026-08-01",
    dateModified: "2026-08-05",
    author: { "@type": "Person", "name": "Hanfu Dress Guide Editorial Team" }
  }}
>
<main class="section" style="max-width:48rem;margin:4rem auto;padding:0 1.5rem;">
<h1 style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
<p style="color:var(--color-muted);margin-bottom:2rem;">Last updated: August 5, 2026</p>

<h2 style="margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Information We Collect</h2>
<p>Hanfu Dress Guide does not require user accounts. We do not collect personal information unless you voluntarily contact us. When you visit our site, standard server logs may record your IP address, browser type, and pages visited for analytics purposes.</p>

<h2 style="margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Cookies</h2>
<p>We use minimal cookies for site functionality. We do not use tracking cookies for advertising purposes. You can disable cookies in your browser settings at any time.</p>

<h2 style="margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>We may link to third-party retailers (such as Etsy, Amazon, and independent Hanfu shops). When you click these links and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. These third-party sites have their own privacy policies.</p>

<h2 style="margin-top:2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Contact</h2>
<p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, please visit our <a href="/legal/contact" style="color:var(--color-accent);">contact page</a>.</p>
</main>
</Layout>
